      "message": "This change adds a consistency check between independent location\nproviders before selecting a fused result.\n\nWhen two temporally comparable location fixes differ beyond their\ncombined reported accuracy, the fused provider does not select either\nsource and retains the last fused result.\n\nThe goal is to avoid selecting a location when providers produce\nmutually inconsistent outputs, while preserving existing behavior when\ninputs are consistent.\n\nHappy to refine the threshold or behavior based on feedback.",
